	(footprint "Nexperia_SOT1216_DFN1010B-6"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "c72f04a8-ccee-48ae-a529-9614ca612fe3")
		(at 1.68 10.33 180)
		(descr "Nexperia DFN1010B-6 (SOT1216), 1.1x1.0x0.37 mm, 0.35 mm pitch, e.g. PMCXB290UE. Lands/paste/resist per Nexperia reflow footprint sot1216_fr (issue 17-03-31; PMCXB290UE data sheet 30 May 2023 Fig. 32): 6 lands 0.20x0.25, paste 0.20x0.35, resist 0.30x0.35. Pads 7/8 = exposed drain pads (D1/D2), copper under solder resist, NOT soldered: Nexperia's land pattern has no drain lands. Pin 1 bottom-left (same orientation as EasyEDA SOT1216_L1.1-W1.0-P0.35-BL-EP). https://assets.nexperia.com/documents/data-sheet/PMCXB290UE.pdf")
